### Health
GET http://localhost:5000/health

### Create an order
POST http://localhost:5000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "order_id": "ORD-1001",
  "customer_email": "customer@example.com",
  "items": [
    {"sku": "SKU-KEYBOARD", "quantity": 2},
    {"sku": "SKU-MOUSE", "quantity": 1}
  ]
}

### Get an order
GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders/ORD-1001

### Allocate inventory
POST http://localhost:5000/api/orders/ORD-1001/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event_id": "EVT-1001-A",
  "status": "ALLOCATED"
}

### Fulfilment report
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reports/fulfilment
